 r={'module_simulation_completed':False,'simulator_returncode':run.returncode,'scope':'Extracted native6MOS product-current core, typical27C. Three (x,y) points (0,.05),(.025,.05),(.05,.05)V with VBASE=.9V. Ideal external sum/difference gate formatting and1.65V output-voltage fixture; source voltages are scaled analog deviations, not trained weights or stored amplitude mapping. No native formatter, resident amplitude buffering, channel penalty sum or complete adaptation yet. Mirror offset, non-square-law error and output compliance retained. No model precision/population5ms/full-chip acceptance.','product_map_precision_accepted':False,'complete_adaptation_accepted':False}
